<title>USA: Puerto Rico Electric repriced, top yield unchanged.</title>
<headline>Puerto Rico Electric repriced, top yield unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co., Inc. said Wednesday it repriced and restructured Puerto Rico Electric's $566 million bond deal, raising yields and adding to the par amount.</p>
<p>The repricing/restructure follows:</p>
<p>PUERTO RICO ELECTRIC POWER AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $565,825,000*</p>
<p>POWER REVENUE BONDS, SERIES AA</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>ALL ORDERS PREVIOUSLY ENTERED WILL BE CONSIDERED GOOD UNLESS</p>
<p>WE HEAR FROM YOU TO THE CONTRARY BY 3:00 PM EDST., TODAY</p>
<p>WEDNESDAY, MAY 7, 1997.</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE REPRICING.</p>
